{"id":"wb-5-500","name":"中山纪念堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中山纪念堂 (广州市)","text":"广州中山纪念堂是广东省广州市的标志性建筑之一，位于越秀区北京街道莲花井社区东风中路295号，北靠越秀山，正对广州市人民代表大会常务委员会办公楼，左邻广东省人民政府。纪念堂由著名建筑师吕彦直和结构师李铿、冯宝龄设计，民国十八年（1929年）动工，民国二十年（1931年）建成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E5%A0%82_(%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":95419940,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95419940","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/42776b9864a9fed255c4092b.jpg","title":"Guangzhou_Yuexiu_Zhongshan_Jinian_Tang_2024-09-19_14.55.41.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Yuexiu_Zhongshan_Jinian_Tang_2024-09-19_14.55.41.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Guangzhou_Yuexiu_Zhongshan_Jinian_Tang_2024-09-19_14.55.41.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"古海岸遗址","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​中山紀念堂，位於中國廣東省廣州市越秀區北京街道蓮花井社區東風中路295號。建於民國二十年（1931）。屬於全國重點文物保護單位。","width":320,"height":240}}